      <h1>Inverted Pendulum: Simulink Controller Design</h1>
      <!--introduction-->
      <p>From the <a href="?example=InvertedPendulum&amp;section=SimulinkModeling">Inverted Pendulum: Simulink Modeling</a> page we generated two different simulation models. We will now employ these models within Simulink to design different approaches
         to control and simulate the resulting closed-loop behavior.
      </p>
	  </div>
	  <div class="related_links">
